<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on April 11.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on April 11.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				April 11	     April 10</p>
<p>Fed acct			 5.277		  5.680</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	   6.173		  5.093</p>
<p>Cash balance		  11.449		 10.772</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,291.406	     5,292.981</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $6.319 billion were issued and $119 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
